# Purpose: Fetch a single product by its UUID

GET {{baseUrl}}/products/94c2a0f5-e629-4748-ab26-8faffddb479f

###

# ! TEST 15 - Get Product By ID - NOT FOUND
# Expected: HTTP 404 Not Found
# Purpose: Verify missing product handling

GET {{baseUrl}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

